{"id": "Db_H8ScP5y-", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"SKILL\" to get Agent Skills and start vibe coding like a senior engineer.\n\nThis Claude skill lets you vibe code like a senior engineer.\n\nIt's called Agent Skills.\n\nIt's a pack of 24 different skills built by a former Google engineering lead.\n\nIt's already crossed 76,000 stars on GitHub.\n\nIt has dedicated skills for planning, coding, testing, and publishing.\n\nIt activates the right one at the different stage of coding, completely on its own.\n\nYou just explain your idea.\n\nIt turns that into a full plan with clear tasks and checkpoints.\n\nThink of it like handing your idea to a whole engineering team instead of one solo coder.\n\nThen as it codes, it follows the same best practices used at top engineering teams.\n\nIt tests its own work as it goes.\n\nNo more shipping broken code and finding out during a client demo.\n\nAnd before it ships anything, it runs a full senior level review.\n\nIt goes through a full pre-launch checklist.\n\nSo nothing breaks the moment you go live.\n\nThis covers the entire dev cycle, so nothing gets skipped.\n\nYou get a fully production ready app in one go.\n\nIt even works across 70 plus AI coding tools, not just Claude Code.\n\n#claudeskill #aicoding #vibecoding #agentskill #claudecode", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1786637210, "like_count": 4754, "comment_count": 8111, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-3455569007944867a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.539, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.